# What must not be uploaded.
#
# The deployment needs the artifacts the API reads, and nothing else. Two exclusions
# here are about content rather than size:
#
#   data/                       course exports - session bodies, quiz text. `.gitignore`
#                               calls them "large, proprietary". Without them the detail
#                               panel's excerpts are unavailable and it says so through
#                               its existing `NO_EXCERPT` path; every other fact about a
#                               finding - where, what, the fix, the evidence - still
#                               renders. That is the trade this deployment makes.
#   out/content_records.jsonl   34MB of the same course text, read only by ingest and
#                               analyse, never by the API.
#
# state/ is excluded because it is writable state on a host that has no writable state.
data/
state/
out/content_records.jsonl
out/screenshots/
out/decks_*.json

.git/
.github/
tests/
eval/
docs/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.venv/
venv/
.env
.env.local
Dockerfile
docker-entrypoint.sh
.dockerignore
fly.toml
